  "about": {
    "description": "afi-rwaUSDi is AFI's institutional ERC-4626 Proof-of-Reserve receipt token for locked rwaUSDi issued by Multipli. AFI docs say the vault locks rwaUSDi as non-circulating collateral and mints 1 afi-rwaUSDi per rwaUSDi deposited, creating a provable onchain wrapper for institutional DeFi use. The underlying rwaUSDi targets private credit, structured finance, project finance, asset-backed lending, and market-neutral strategies. Reserve status and attestation history are exposed through AFI's verification app. Vault access is institutionally gated / deposit-closed, approved entities are required for access, transfers are disabled per project submission, and AFI's public custody docs describe the protocol as non-custodial.",
